> References

- MFEM, [Weak Formulations](https://mfem.org/fem_weak_form/): basis expansion,
  Galerkin equations and the integration-by-parts boundary convention.
- Douglas N. Arnold (2012-12-15 version), *Numerical Analysis of Partial
  Differential Equations*, University of Minnesota MATH 8445 lecture notes,
  chapter 4 sections 8.1–8.2 and chapter 5 section 2.
  [Author-hosted notes](https://www-users.cse.umn.edu/~arnold/8445.f12/notes.pdf).
  The norm estimates require regularity/coercivity assumptions; the native
  quadrature, boundary/source choices and actual time grid are specified above.
